sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Transcript as Transcript provider
    participant Caller as Tool caller
    participant Control as Controller
    participant Room as Room lookup
    participant Queue as Result queue
    participant Adapter as Duplex adapter
    participant Model as Speech model

    Note over User,Model: Illustrative correction scenario using the project's room fixtures. The final spoken answer is a research target and is not a proven human-run result.
    User->>Adapter: Audio: "Where is the robotics seminar?"
    Adapter->>Model: Continue the same audio conversation
    User->>Transcript: Spoken question
    Transcript->>Caller: Committed text: "Where is the robotics seminar?"
    Caller->>Control: Call room_lookup(name="robotics seminar")
    Control->>Room: Request 17, version 1

    User->>Adapter: Audio: "Actually, the vision seminar."
    Adapter->>Model: Continue audio without waiting for lookup
    User->>Transcript: Spoken correction
    Transcript->>Caller: Committed correction: "vision seminar"
    Caller->>Control: Amend request 17: room_lookup(name="vision seminar")
    Control->>Room: Request 17, version 2

    Room-->>Control: Late version 1 result: robotics = B742
    Control--xQueue: Discard version 1 because request 17 is now version 2
    Room-->>Control: Version 2 result: vision = C314
    Control->>Queue: Accept current fact: vision seminar is in C314
    Adapter->>Queue: At next permitted input boundary recheck version 2
    Queue-->>Adapter: Deliver current result only
    Adapter->>Model: Submit short C314 fact in the same session
    Model-->>User: Target answer: "The vision seminar is in room C314."
    Note over Adapter,Model: Log submission, evaluation if known, generated text, audio, and human verdict.
